      "value": "<p>You are keenly aware of your surroundings, especially with regards to things hiding in plain sight. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.2kwXTUjYYhoAGySr]{Incredible Initiative} general feat. When you use the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to look for hidden creatures or look past disguises or lies, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your roll.</p>"
